OL,3,GNEWSACyclist, 78, dies weeks after
OL,4,Acrash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old cyclist has died from his
OL,7,Finjuries more than three weeks after a
OL,8,Fcrash with a car, police have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,FA1156 Felixstowe Road, near Trinity
OL,13,FPark, in Ipswich, just after 17:15 BST
OL,14,Fon 6 October.
OL,16,FSuffolk Police said the man had
OL,17,Fsuffered "potentially life-threatening
OL,18,Finjuries" in a collision with a black
OL,19,FHyundai Tucson.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
